{"game": "sniper-elite-resistance", "language": "english", "appid": 2169200, "month": "2026-01", "window": 4, "start_date": 1769212800, "end_date": 1769903999, "month_true_total": 122, "quota": 9, "returned": 9, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 09:04:51 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "217259997", "author": {"steamid": "76561198383106851", "personaname": "Timonsurvivor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/timon-muller/", "num_games_owned": 172, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1935, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1747, "last_played": 1771673215, "avatar": "3604ac34b47c87e187d151f22aa17e107253ce34"}, "language": "english", "review": "Absolutely loved it!\r\n\r\nSniper Elite: Resistance completely hooked me from the start. The level design is fantastic, giving you so many ways to approach each mission—whether you want to go full stealth or take a more aggressive route. The sniping feels incredibly satisfying, and lining up the perfect long-distance shot never gets old.\r\n\r\nThe atmosphere is tense and immersive, the visuals look great, and the gameplay loop kept me coming back for “just one more mission.” You really feel rewarded for planning, patience, and smart positioning. As a fan of tactical shooters, I had an amazing time with this game and was genuinely enthusiastic the whole way through. Highly recommended!", "timestamp_created": 1769873087, "timestamp_updated": 1769873087, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217258543", "author": {"steamid": "76561199388412011", "personaname": "M.R.Gツ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/_M_R_G_/", "num_games_owned": 317, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 1396, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1366, "last_played": 1769873759, "avatar": "fb406b899fcf134a53bda00749b33a283ea4e3bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "very Epic", "timestamp_created": 1769871921, "timestamp_updated": 1769871921, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.477540194988250732", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217200357", "author": {"steamid": "76561199626441480", "personaname": "tmperez88", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199626441480/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 536, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1, "playtime_at_review": 213, "last_played": 1790825941, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "9/10 it would be a 10/10 if i could find out how to make my fps to 30 to 60 or 120", "timestamp_created": 1769809948, "timestamp_updated": 1769809948, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.474218159914016724", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217189889", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032118032", "personaname": "intertelect", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198032118032/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 6810, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 299, "last_played": 1782145808, "avatar": "4ca66d26e3bd592eed6b6efbeb4b88e604e8f201"}, "language": "english", "review": "I sorta like this game. I've played all of the other Sniper Elite games and this one just squeaks into the recommend category.  I'm not sure how to describe it but this seems like a 3rd party knock-off. The graphics and gameplay seem to be a bit off. All of the elements are there but it just feels wrong.", "timestamp_created": 1769802415, "timestamp_updated": 1769802415, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217176994", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028326415", "personaname": "Mibs101", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198028326415/", "num_games_owned": 234, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 2818, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2587, "last_played": 1770755821, "avatar": "d97386ae0f3c36011032dd3ccbe78d7aff66b784"}, "language": "english", "review": "sneaky snipers", "timestamp_created": 1769792759, "timestamp_updated": 1769792759, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217163198", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049155074", "personaname": "labsys06", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198049155074/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 39, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 39, "last_played": 1769726884, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Apparently not a problem for everybody but I was unable to get the crosshair to appear. I noted others in comments on other sites that this is a problem for some with no fix that I discovered. Too bad as I absolutely love this series and was looking forward to playing this latest addtion. Unfortunately this problem makes the game unplayable for me.", "timestamp_created": 1769779536, "timestamp_updated": 1769779536, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217139517", "author": {"steamid": "76561198320859760", "personaname": "evilthx", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198320859760/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1714, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 470, "last_played": 1772761011, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's been a hoot so far!!", "timestamp_created": 1769744459, "timestamp_updated": 1769744459, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217134812", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037210264", "personaname": "Nightcrawlrworm", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198037210264/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 1981, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 332, "last_played": 1773717905, "avatar": "edef9130eaf19a1db3e1a8abb6e72b884dcbb71c"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've played all of the SE titles over the years. This one is a great continuation of the series.  No it isn't bleeding edge graphics, but it is most certainly the best looking of the series.  It's a bit better than a DLC, but what I noticed is the enemy AI is smarter than previous versions.  And there is a lot of expansive locales.  I do think this title plays as a bridge between SE5 and the next, so let's call it SE5.5.  Developers, can we get some serious weather and more things like non enemy civilians? Otherwise, I'm happy.", "timestamp_created": 1769737992, "timestamp_updated": 1769737992, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49802282452583313", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217120137", "author": {"steamid": "76561197966673269", "personaname": "acanfield", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197966673269/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 2051, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 846, "last_played": 1770350747, "avatar": "3b101a73d50ffad6592bcb3610b90ee6a9b921a0"}, "language": "english", "review": "The open map, physics, combat, stealth, weapons customization, challenging opponents, and graphics make these Sniper Elite games must-play for first-person shooter fans. The games are also highly replayable with multiple approaches to each mission and near impossible odds on the highest skill settings.  There are some playability issues with stuttering and hang-ups on this edition that I haven't been able to fix even at the lowest graphics settings, though.", "timestamp_created": 1769720678, "timestamp_updated": 1769720678, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}]}